          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "পাণ্ডুলিপি (pānḍulipi) joins Sanskrit pāṇḍu, 'pale, yellowish white' (Monier-Williams), to lipi, 'writing'. Monier-Williams has the older pāṇḍulekha, a first sketch in chalk; পাণ্ডুলিপি is a work in the writer's own hand, before it is printed."
            }
          ]
